### Buchhandlung — local API (IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client)
### Start the app, then run each request with the editor's "Run request" action.
### Sample books: Modern Classic German Literature

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Home
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Create book — Die Blechtrommel (Günter Grass)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Die Blechtrommel",
  "author": "Günter Grass",
  "isbn": "978-3423135409",
  "price": 16.99
}

### Create book — Der Vorleser (Bernhard Schlink)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Der Vorleser",
  "author": "Bernhard Schlink",
  "isbn": "978-3257229530",
  "price": 14.99
}

### Create book — Der Steppenwolf (Hermann Hesse)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Der Steppenwolf",
  "author": "Hermann Hesse",
  "isbn": "978-3518380680",
  "price": 13.99
}

### Find book by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/1

### Find book by id — not found
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/1000000

### Find all books
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books

### Find books by author
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/search?author=Bernhard%20Schlink

### Update book by id (change id and body as needed)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Die Blechtrommel",
  "author": "Günter Grass",
  "isbn": "978-3423135409",
  "price": 15.49
}

### Delete book by id
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/books/1

### Delete all books
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/books
